# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DATA & MODELS — NEVER COMMIT
# The EXIST 2026 dataset is released under a usage agreement that prohibits
# redistribution, and it contains sensitive biometric (EEG / eye-tracking /
# heart-rate) and demographic data. Trained weights and extracted features are
# derived from it and are also large. See DATA.md for how to obtain the data.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Raw dataset (images + annotations + sensor signals)
EXIST 2026 Memes Dataset/
*EXIST2026_training.json
*EXIST2026_test*.json

# Extracted features (embeddings of the protected data)
project/features/
*.npy
*.pkl

# Trained model weights / checkpoints
project/models/
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.bin
*.ckpt
*_ckpt/

# Evaluation gold/pred data (contains gold labels)
project/eval_pyevall/
evaluation/

# Packaged submissions / archives
*.zip

# PDFs (lab guidelines, reference papers — not redistributable)
*.pdf

